@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
title MultiPicker — Native plugin boundaries
top to bottom direction
component "Native course file picker" as Picker
component "Course / admin pages" as Pages
component repository_multipicker as Repository
component local_multipicker as Local
database "MultiPicker metadata" as Metadata
component "Moodle File /\nmodule APIs" as Files
component "Moodle Task /\nLock APIs" as Tasks
Picker --> Repository
Repository --> Local
Pages --> Local
Local --> Metadata
Local --> Files
Local --> Tasks
Picker -[hidden]right-> Pages
Metadata -[hidden]right-> Files
Files -[hidden]right-> Tasks
note bottom of Metadata : No binary store or persistent asset table.
@enduml
